If a patient has a prolonged-opioid-use for a few-day-period then the patient can possibly need a prophylactic-pharmacologic-bowel-therapy for a regular-bowel-movement.
A prophylactic-pharmacologic-bowel-therapy-example includes a stimulant-laxative-example.
A stimulant-laxative-example is a senna-example.
It is possible that a prophylactic-pharmacologic-bowel-therapy-example includes a stool-softener-example.
